## Where Nix builds live in current Flox

**`flake.nix`** at your project root is where the Nix package build definition lives. The old `nix-builds.toml` format has been replaced by Nix flakes. Your environment manifest can live in:
- **`.flox/flox.nix`** (structured Nix) — recommended for Flox environments
- **`.flox/flox.toml`** (TOML format) — for simple declarative environments

